  <xs:annotation><xs:documentation xml:lang="en"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
    <h1>Adobe Flash publish profiles</h1>
    <p>Companion schema for namespace-free PublishSettings.xml. Author: Jindra Petrik (JPEXS). License: CC-BY-4.0, like xfl.xsd.</p>
    <p>Scalar values remain strings because native profiles include empty numeric and enumeration fields.</p>
    <h2>Changelog</h2><ul><li><b>2026-10-23 v2.1.0</b>: Added SWC publish fields (swc, swcDefaultName, swcFileName) and the newer CompressionType setting.</li><li><b>2026-10-22 v2.0.0</b>: Added publish profile groups, library metadata and accepted legacy library-path fields.</li></ul>
  </div></xs:documentation></xs:annotation>
